description:
Addresses code review feedback on PR #21 to reduce CSS duplication where the same base color (`#a2b8cb`) and `color-mix()` expressions were repeated for both block and inline content switchers.

## Changes

- **Added CSS custom property** `--content-switcher-tint` for the base color
- **Consolidated common rules** into `.content-switcher:not(.content-switcher-hidden)` for shared background/border styling
- **Separated element-specific properties** (padding, border-radius) into distinct selectors for block (`div`, `section`) vs inline (`span`) elements

## Before/After

Before:
```css
div.content-switcher:not(.content-switcher-hidden) {
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, #a2b8cb 25%, #FFFFFF 75%);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #a2b8cb 50%, #FFFFFF 50%);
  /* element-specific properties */
}

span.content-switcher:not(.content-switcher-hidden) {
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, #a2b8cb 25%, #FFFFFF 75%);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #a2b8cb 50%, #FFFFFF 50%);
  /* element-specific properties */
}
```

After:
```css
:root {
  --content-switcher-tint: #a2b8cb;
}

.content-switcher:not(.content-switcher-hidden) {
  background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--content-switcher-tint) 25%, #FFFFFF 75%);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--content-switcher-tint) 50%, #FFFFFF 50%);
}

/* Element-specific properties only */
div.content-switcher:not(.content-switcher-hidden),
section.content-switcher:not(.content-switcher-hidden) { /* ... */ }

span.content-switcher:not(.content-switcher-hidden) { /* ... */ }
```

Future tint color changes now require updating only the custom property.

